(text "PROTOTYPE: ACC resistor divider + D911 BAT54 (A=1, K=2) starts EN independent of 5V. Opto U911 powered by VIN permits post-ACC MCU_HOLD only during independent 555 grant. U912 optically generates 3V3-level ACC sense for 01C trigger." (at 29 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "79ac0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000059"))
(text "CRITICAL: photocoupler U911 VCEO, CTR at -40C and LED current, exact pinout/footprint, 9V and 30V thresholds, ACC transient protection, 01C 555 proper trigger and 3V3 power, power-on behavior ALL REQUIRE VERIFICATION. DO NOT FABRICATE." (at 29 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "79ac0001-0000-4000-8000-000000000060")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))